{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cbdaae0b6c18120d0ba17f24c506ea0e87317fc9541d254ca2cb7ec5c9288537", "ja": "（真美たちのヒップホップ活動が順調だ！　今日も\nまた新たな会場でのラップバトルが待ち受ける……）", "zh": "（真美她们的嘻哈活动进展顺利！今天在新的场地，又有一场说唱对决等待着她们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0203_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6c968a6e2cfda4a5a43afb5e278099d026686db134d832b0707a4b9dee20c2d", "ja": "兄ちゃーん。亜美と律っちゃん、まだー？", "zh": "哥哥——亚美和律子姐还没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
