{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0203_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "c654f7aa5bfb511ea606346d1cae0aeefaf513c8428a124874a6ef4ef2c805fa", "ja": "そう？　サンクスありがとうYO！　MEN！", "zh": "是吗？谢啦，多谢哟！兄弟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
